  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>|</mo></mrow></math>, then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is:</p>",
    "image": null
